   "created_at": "2018-01-16T09:21:26Z",
   "updated_at": "2018-01-16T09:21:26Z",
   "body": "@konklone i see your point, but at current stage we already have multiple-rating scheme such as:\r\n- SSL Labs\r\n- Mozilla HTTP Observatory\r\n\r\nWhere SSL Labs gives A+, Mozilla HTTP Observatory can gives D.\r\n\r\nSo, it would be nice to have also pshtt gives a simplified rating, because independent parties may just get multiple rating from multiple-tools and exposed that.\r\n\r\nThe outcome of having multiple rating is simple, like at school, your goal is to have the best rating to all of the different \"exams\" .\r\n\r\nI am really looking forward to have a simplified rating from multiple tools, that can be shown in a simplified way, then it will be up to the technician to dig into each of them in order to fix or improve their situation",
   "author_association": "NONE",
   "pin": null,
