   "created_at": "2018-01-16T14:50:55Z",
   "updated_at": "2018-01-16T14:50:55Z",
   "body": "Thanks for your comments, @fpietrosanti. \r\n\r\nI'm in alignment with you regarding an approach that summarizes key elements of security simply so that an operator can improve things. But @konklone's comment about \"maintenance over time\" in particular is the thing that makes your suggestion onerous for us to implement. [SSL Labs and co.](https://twitter.com/ivanristic/status/946470597571371008) do an excellent job in this space, and we're not likely to take on this burden.\r\n\r\nClosing this issue for now.",
